@* The beta feedback address as text, with a copy button — XgidLabel's button
   pattern: an icon button whose accessible name is real text, which carries the
   copy's result. Rendered beside each feedback link (Home's footer, Help's
   feedback paragraph), where the mailto: link stays. *@
<span class="feedback-address">
    <code class="feedback-address-text">@AppInfo.FeedbackAddress</code>
    <button type="button"
            class="feedback-address-copy @_copy.ShowingClass"
            title="@Name"
            @onclick="CopyAsync">
        <span class="visually-hidden">@Name</span>
    </button>
</span>
